{
 "_report": "Helix Station on the V3 kit. Arrive at the Docking Ring (kept: medical bay, Barracks/Labs/Observation Deck doors, shuttle gate). East through Habitation Row (Lane Homes -> Crew Quarters) to Deck Crossroads, the main hub: north is the story chain Containment Wing 1F -> 2F -> Engineering -> Vex's Arena (all kept, re-joined edge to edge), south the Spaceport (second gate home), east the Coolant Fork. Coolant Fork: north Officers Court (houses, Command Bridge), south the Coolant Basin water edge and a side route Docking Ramp -> Reactor Channel -> Specimen Annex -> Viewport Overlook (dead end, chest); east the Corridor Junction hub. Corridor Junction: north Hangar Deck -> Rift Rock Mine (entrance + 1F/2F/Deep Chamber, chest); east the Helix Proving Grounds (lobby -> battle room) and on to the Comms Spire (trial floor -> uplink room, chest; no keeper, Admin Vex stays the boss in 113); south Hydroponics Edge (houses, Containment Lab) and the Hidden Hydro Garden (chest).",
